## 2. Definitions

For the purposes of this License:

**"Software"** means the source code, binaries, documentation, configuration, and other materials distributed as part of this project.

**"Community Core"** means the publicly available portion of the Software developed and distributed under this License.

**"Modified Version"** means any work based on, derived from, or incorporating substantial portions of the Software.

**"Cloud Edition"** means the hosted, managed, or subscription-based version of the Software operated and commercially provided by Igor Dlugosh, including any proprietary services, infrastructure, features, or components associated with it.

**"Commercial Distribution"** means selling, licensing, renting, leasing, sublicensing, or otherwise providing the Software or a Modified Version to third parties in exchange for payment or other commercial consideration.

**"Hosted Service"** means making the Software or a Modified Version available to third parties over a network, including as a SaaS, PaaS, managed service, hosted application, or similar commercial offering.

**"Competing Product"** means a commercially offered product or service whose primary purpose and core functionality substantially overlap with the Software or Cloud Edition.

